#. y1:english="Arrrgh! It hurts!\nHey, dumbass!||Look where you're going!!\nHey! Are you alright?\nI don't think I'll make it!||He fucked up my shoulder!\nHang in there, man!{PA:15}\nShit, his shoulder is completely fucked!\nHey, asshole!||What are you gonna do about this?\nI'm too busy to fuck around||with the likes of you.\nWhoa, whoa.\nYou hurt my friend here pretty bad||and now you think you can just walk away?!\nWell, since we're pacifists,||we want to avoid any sort of conflict.\nSo, we'll forgive you||if you pay us 10,000 yen.\n\nHere you go.||Are you happy now?\nHehehe. You are very understanding.\nYou know,||avoiding conflict is good for both parties.\nOwww...||My shoulder might be dislocated.\nShut up! Let's go.||We're done with him.\n\nSorry, but I don't have any money.\nWhat the fuck do you think||you're doing around here with no cash?\nGah, fuck it.\nI guess we'll have to jack him||for all he's got.\n\nWhy the hell would I pay you?\nIt's too late to apologize...\nYou don't wanna fuck around||with pacifists like us.\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/OLD_KAB0012.BIN:134_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/OLD_KAB0012.BIN::line:134_0_0"
msgid "iArggg! iDuele!"
msgstr ""

